# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# MemGuard LLM Configuration
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
#
# Copy this file as .env and modify settings:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Environment variables take priority over .env file.
# If neither is set, defaults are used.

# ── Provider Selection ───────────────────────
# Supported: openai | anthropic | ollama | openai_compatible
MEMGUARD_LLM_PROVIDER=openai

# ── Model Name ───────────────────────────────
# Defaults are chosen automatically based on provider:
#   openai            → gpt-4o-mini
#   anthropic         → claude-sonnet-4-6
#   ollama            → qwen2.5:7b
#   openai_compatible → gpt-4o-mini
MEMGUARD_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# ── API Key ────────────────────────────────────
# Universal variable (all providers read this)
# MEMGUARD_LLM_API_KEY=sk-xxx
#
# Or use provider-specific variables:
#   openai / openai_compatible → OPENAI_API_KEY
#   anthropic                  → ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
#   ollama                     → Not needed

# ── Custom API URL ───────────────────────────
# Set when using openai_compatible / ollama
# MEMGUARD_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.together.xyz/v1
# MEMGUARD_LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1

# ── Generation Parameters ────────────────────────
# MEMGUARD_LLM_TEMPERATURE=0.7
# MEMGUARD_LLM_MAX_TOKENS=100


# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Common Configuration Examples (uncomment to use)
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# --- OpenAI ---
# MEMGUARD_LLM_PROVIDER=openai
# MEMGUARD_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-xxx

# --- Anthropic Claude ---
# MEMGUARD_LLM_PROVIDER=anthropic
# MEMGUARD_LLM_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxx

# --- Local Ollama (Qwen) ---
# MEMGUARD_LLM_PROVIDER=ollama
# MEMGUARD_LLM_MODEL=qwen2.5:7b
# MEMGUARD_LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1

# --- Local Ollama (Llama) ---
# MEMGUARD_LLM_PROVIDER=ollama
# MEMGUARD_LLM_MODEL=llama3.1:8b
# MEMGUARD_LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1

# --- Together AI ---
# MEMGUARD_LLM_PROVIDER=openai_compatible
# MEMGUARD_LLM_MODEL=mistralai/Mixtral-8x7B-Instruct-v0.1
# MEMGUARD_LLM_API_KEY=your-together-api-key
# MEMGUARD_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.together.xyz/v1

# --- Groq ---
# MEMGUARD_LLM_PROVIDER=openai_compatible
# MEMGUARD_LLM_MODEL=llama-3.1-70b-versatile
# MEMGUARD_LLM_API_KEY=gsk_xxx
# MEMGUARD_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1

# --- DeepSeek ---
# Customer-support Agent Server (server-side only)
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek-v4-flash
LANGSMITH_TRACING=false
LANGSMITH_API_KEY=
LANGSMITH_PROJECT=memguard-customer-support-baseline

# --- Local vLLM ---
# MEMGUARD_LLM_PROVIDER=openai_compatible
# MEMGUARD_LLM_MODEL=your-model-name
# MEMGUARD_LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/v1
